WEBVTT

00:01.837 --> 00:04.407
We are the knights of Earl Steim!

00:06.867 --> 00:09.077
With this Sword of Transcendence,

00:09.077 --> 00:13.657
we have nothing to fear
from the Blood Witch!

00:15.557 --> 00:17.377
The way that sword's lit up...

00:17.907 --> 00:20.257
Is it a more powerful class?

00:22.337 --> 00:27.047
<b>m 0 0 l 200 0 200 50 0 50</b>

00:22.337 --> 00:27.047
<b></b>Quest
<b>The Eighth Servant (SS)</b>

Save the Yatan cultists who are
 trapped in their temple by Earl Steim's army.
Become the Eighth Servant of Yatan.

Clear Reward: Rank "The Eighth Servant"
*Eighth Servant: Skill "Infinite Faith"
Skill: "Speak the Teachings"
Skill: "Divine Punishment"

Failure: Level -5, Faith -1,000

00:22.717 --> 00:27.047
If so, that'll make this 
quest difficult to clear.

00:27.377 --> 00:28.697
How should I deal with this?

00:34.957 --> 00:35.937
The sky...

00:45.367 --> 00:47.357
<i>Do you desire power?</i>

00:51.057 --> 00:54.627
<i>If you desire power, wish for it.</i>

00:54.627 --> 00:59.087
<i>I shall grant it to you.</i>

01:00.447 --> 01:03.127
<i>This is Yatan's voice...</i>

01:03.897 --> 01:07.617
<i>Now, wish for what you desire.</i>

01:08.587 --> 01:16.397
<i>If you want power, then wish 
for me to grant your desire.</i>

01:16.397 --> 01:18.727
<i>I will grant you power.</i>

01:19.107 --> 01:22.977
<i>If you desire power, wish for it.</i>

01:23.067 --> 01:25.797
<i>If you desire power, wish for it.</i>

01:25.797 --> 01:28.597
<i>I shall grant you power.</i>

01:28.697 --> 01:32.657
<i>I shall grant you power.</i>

01:30.507 --> 01:32.657
Yes, I...

01:32.907 --> 01:36.117
<i>I shall grant you power.</i>

01:37.707 --> 01:39.247
I want power.

01:44.577 --> 01:48.557
The power to fight things that 
black magic alone can't.

01:45.317 --> 01:50.007
<b>Black Transformation</b>

02:11.257 --> 02:12.787
<b>Overgeared</b>

02:12.787 --> 02:15.887
<b>Overgeared</b>

03:23.127 --> 03:27.517
<i>My stats went up a bunch after 
crafting that legendary item.</i>

03:28.097 --> 03:31.147
<i>But we're still 60 million yen in debt.</i>

03:32.387 --> 03:38.027
<i>I need to make money in 
</i>Satisfy<i> and save my family.</i>

03:41.707 --> 03:44.207
Grid, what are you making?

03:44.827 --> 03:47.757
Oh, a crafting hammer.

03:48.177 --> 03:52.377
I've been using the ones that were lying 
around, but they're all broken now.

03:52.377 --> 03:54.337
What?! Are you insane?!

03:54.627 --> 03:57.037
A hammer is a blacksmith's life!

03:57.037 --> 03:58.897
I-It is?

03:58.897 --> 03:59.767
Just a moment.

04:06.817 --> 04:08.697
Here, this is mine.

04:08.787 --> 04:13.647
<b>Excellent Blacksmith's Hammer</b>

04:08.787 --> 04:13.647
<b></b>Class: Rare

04:08.787 --> 04:13.647
<b></b>m 0 0 l 48 0 48 5 0 5

04:08.787 --> 04:13.647
<b></b>Durability

04:08.787 --> 04:13.647
<b></b>Attack

04:08.787 --> 04:13.647
<b></b>Rare Item Crafting Rate

04:08.787 --> 04:13.647
<b></b>Equip Conditions: Level 80, STR 60+

04:08.787 --> 04:13.647
<b></b>Intermediate Blacksmith's Skill

04:08.787 --> 04:13.647
<b></b>m 0 0 l 48 0 48 8 0 8

04:08.787 --> 04:13.647
<b></b>m 0 0 l 48 0 48 8 0 8

04:08.787 --> 04:13.647
<b></b>m 0 0 l 128 0 128 8 0 8

04:08.787 --> 04:13.647
<b></b>m 0 0 l 128 0 128 10 0 10

04:09.087 --> 04:13.647
Huh? Rare Item Crafting Rate +10%?

04:14.247 --> 04:18.597
Honestly... If you'd been 
using a better hammer,

04:18.597 --> 04:20.417
you wouldn't have had as much tro—

04:19.617 --> 04:22.867
Why didn't you tell me sooner?!

04:25.267 --> 04:26.627
<b><b>Nameless Blacksmith's Hammer
</b>Class: Epic

Durability: 350/350
Attack: 70~80
Rare Item Crafting Rate:+17%
Epic Item Crafting Rate: +7%
Equip Conditions: Pagma's Successor</b>

04:25.267 --> 04:26.627
<b>m 0 0 l 200 0 200 36 0 36</b>

04:26.627 --> 04:28.197
I-It's done!

04:28.197 --> 04:29.767
My own hammer!

04:29.767 --> 04:34.397
I've been laughing a lot 
more since you showed up.

04:34.397 --> 04:37.717
This isn't a joke!

04:38.547 --> 04:41.767
I have a favor to ask, by the way.

04:41.767 --> 04:43.597
A favor? What is it?

04:44.797 --> 04:47.587
Today's the anniversary of my son's death.

04:47.977 --> 04:51.337
Would you come to his grave with me?

04:59.007 --> 05:01.687
My family's always been buried here.

05:03.157 --> 05:06.577
And this is my son Oliver's grave.

05:07.967 --> 05:10.917
He was a great blacksmith.

05:11.437 --> 05:14.587
I was planning on having 
him take over for me.

05:15.047 --> 05:17.697
But he died so young...

05:20.447 --> 05:22.627
It's been ten years since he died,

05:22.627 --> 05:25.867
but not a day has passed 
when I don't think of him.

05:28.367 --> 05:32.257
<i>I guess NPCs care about 
their families, too.</i>

05:36.857 --> 05:38.197
Oliver...

05:38.657 --> 05:41.507
You know who I brought with me today?

05:42.147 --> 05:47.157
Pagma's Successor, the guy you 
always wanted to talk about.

05:48.077 --> 05:52.287
I work with him every day now.

05:53.007 --> 05:56.217
He saved our forge.

05:56.487 --> 05:58.897
And I've quit drinking, too.

05:59.407 --> 06:02.677
He's a good kid, just like you.

06:03.697 --> 06:07.067
I want him to take over my forge.

06:11.597 --> 06:14.437
Grid, I want you to take over.

06:16.347 --> 06:17.587
Old Man Khan...

06:18.637 --> 06:20.797
<i>Damn it, </i>Satisfy<i>...</i>

06:20.797 --> 06:23.027
<i>What kind of game is this?</i>

06:24.877 --> 06:27.617
Oliver-san, I'm Grid.

06:28.427 --> 06:31.247
Your dad is my teacher, and I trust him.

06:31.247 --> 06:34.197
He's my dearest friend.

06:35.167 --> 06:39.797
I'll make the forge you were supposed to 
inherit into the greatest in the world.

06:40.587 --> 06:41.497
So...

06:42.137 --> 06:46.177
Keep on watching over me and Old Man Khan!

06:46.967 --> 06:48.497
Grid...

06:49.327 --> 06:51.227
<b></b>Your bond with Khan has been maxed out.

07:01.257 --> 07:02.657
This is...

07:04.887 --> 07:06.247
<i>System guidance.</i>

07:06.627 --> 07:11.667
<i>Khan's ancestors, moved by your 
care for him, have appeared.</i>

07:14.877 --> 07:17.187
Pagma's Successor...

07:15.457 --> 07:17.407
Stay away! Stay away!

07:17.187 --> 07:19.277
Friend of our descendant...

07:17.407 --> 07:19.277
I'm sorry! I'm sorry!

07:19.277 --> 07:20.047
Please don't kill me!

07:20.397 --> 07:24.117
Save me! Mommy!

07:21.547 --> 07:26.977
We have appeared to thank 
you for your kindness.

07:27.597 --> 07:29.007
Thank me?

07:29.367 --> 07:31.417
You see, 130 years ago,

07:31.997 --> 07:35.307
I was awed by the blade of Pagma.

07:37.887 --> 07:42.507
I made a drawing of it 
so I would never forget...

07:43.157 --> 07:48.317
An image of Pagma's Sword Dance, 
on the cliffs of Kesan Canyon.

07:50.517 --> 07:51.387
<b></b>Job Quest
<b>"Pagma's Successor" </b>has been updated<b></b>

07:50.967 --> 07:52.317
<i>System guidance.</i>

07:52.267 --> 07:54.417
<b></b>Job Quest

07:52.267 --> 07:54.417
<b><b>Prove the Legend
</b>Part 1</b>

07:52.267 --> 07:54.417
<b>m 0 0 l 85 0 85 10 0 10</b>

07:52.267 --> 07:54.417
<b></b>Find a clue to Pagma in Kesan Canyon.

07:52.267 --> 07:54.417
<b></b>Clear Condition: Learn Skill "Pagma's Blade Dance"
Clear Reward: Dainsleif (Replica)

07:52.267 --> 07:54.417
<b>m 0 0 l 85 0 85 10 0 10</b>

07:52.317 --> 07:57.407
<i>You have begun the legendary job 
quest "Pagma's Successor, Part 1."</i>

07:54.417 --> 07:58.377
<b></b>Job Quest
<b>Prove the Legend</b>
Part 1

Find a clue to Pagma in Kesan Canyon.

07:54.417 --> 07:58.377
<b>m 0 0 l 200 0 200 21 0 21</b>

07:57.407 --> 08:01.247
<i>This is that job quest...</i>

07:59.877 --> 08:03.717
<b></b>Job Quest
<b>Prove the Legend</b>

Gather all the legends of Pagma
using his Sword Dance as a clue.
Details will be updated as the quest proceeds.


*No time limit
*Once a legendary job quest has begun,
job cannot be changed


Clear Condition: Complete all associated quests.
Clear Reward: Unknown
*Acquired after each quest is completed.

07:59.877 --> 08:03.717
<b>m 0 0 l 200 0 200 58 0 58</b>

08:01.247 --> 08:03.717
<i>I finally got the first one!</i>

08:03.727 --> 08:06.447
<b></b>Clear Condition: Learn Skill "Pagma's Blade Dance"
Clear Reward: Dainsleif (Replica)

08:06.647 --> 08:09.137
Friend of my descendant...

08:09.857 --> 08:14.977
I pray that you become 
even greater than Pagma.

08:15.557 --> 08:16.707
And...

08:18.097 --> 08:21.107
Take care of my dad, would you,

08:21.747 --> 08:22.797
Grid-san?

08:26.227 --> 08:27.277
Of course.

08:27.787 --> 08:28.977
Leave him to me.

08:44.697 --> 08:47.517
Sorry, I nodded off.

08:50.047 --> 08:51.357
Sheesh...

08:51.357 --> 08:54.137
Falling asleep in a place like this...

08:54.737 --> 08:55.857
You need to

08:56.347 --> 08:58.577
take better care of yourself, okay,

08:56.347 --> 08:58.577
take better care of yourself, okay,

08:58.957 --> 09:00.107
Dad?

09:02.677 --> 09:04.017
Grid...

09:04.527 --> 09:06.187
Why are you still turned away from me?

09:06.187 --> 09:07.507
Please don't ask.

09:13.627 --> 09:14.977
You monster!

09:18.937 --> 09:22.187
<i>In the Eternal Kingdom, Earl Steim's army</i>

09:22.187 --> 09:26.007
<i>has once again failed in its attempt 
to defeat the Yatan Church.</i>

09:26.657 --> 09:31.347
<i>The North's greatest knight, 
Phoenix, just barely survived.</i>

09:32.347 --> 09:34.807
<i>Quests are being issued 
all across the continent</i>

09:32.697 --> 09:34.807
<b>Defeat the Yatan Church</b>

09:33.197 --> 09:34.807
<b>Defeat the Yatan Church</b>

09:33.697 --> 09:34.807
<b>Defeat the Yatan Church</b>

09:34.197 --> 09:34.807
<b>Defeat the Yatan Church</b>

09:34.807 --> 09:37.017
<i>in an attempt to stop their expansion.</i>

09:37.697 --> 09:40.777
<i>Famous guilds are starting to take action,</i>

09:40.777 --> 09:44.087
<i>and people are watching to see if 
top-ranking players will join the fight.</i>

09:44.777 --> 09:48.277
I am the Eighth Servant of Yatan.

09:48.277 --> 09:51.487
I have finally overcome the 
limits of a Black Mage.

09:52.157 --> 09:57.167
<i>It is expected that the Yatan Church 
will continue to grow in power,</i>

09:52.577 --> 09:56.657
We must defeat the Yatan 
Church no matter what!

09:57.167 --> 10:01.037
Every country must work together 
to form an army to fight them!

09:57.167 --> 09:58.457
<i>and become a global threat.</i>

10:01.257 --> 10:03.767
Glory to the goddess Rebecca!

10:04.867 --> 10:08.177
<i>Many countries are forming an 
alliance to fight the Yatan Church.</i>

10:08.637 --> 10:13.757
<i>This is the biggest incident 
since </i>Satisfy<i>'s release.</i>

10:13.757 --> 10:17.267
<b>Defeat the Yatan Church</b>

10:13.757 --> 10:17.267
<b>Defeat the Yatan Church</b>

10:13.757 --> 10:17.267
<b>Defeat the Yatan Church</b>

10:13.757 --> 10:17.267
<b>Defeat the Yatan Church</b>

10:14.017 --> 10:18.907
<i>This war will affect 
every player in the game.</i>

10:18.907 --> 10:21.197
Another quest to join the army 
against the Yatan Church?

10:21.197 --> 10:23.227
They're losing pretty bad, I heard.

10:21.927 --> 10:24.997
<i>Lately, all the quests have had 
to do with the Yatan Church...</i>

10:23.227 --> 10:25.527
The village might be in danger.

10:25.917 --> 10:29.357
<i>but my goal is to complete 
my first job quest!</i>

10:30.327 --> 10:31.727
Grid-sama!

10:32.477 --> 10:33.277
You're...

10:33.787 --> 10:34.807
Huroi!

10:34.807 --> 10:36.787
Indeed, 'tis I! Huroi!

10:37.267 --> 10:39.597
I have returned to serve you!

10:39.597 --> 10:42.067
Where the hell have you been?!

10:42.067 --> 10:45.027
You know what kind of shit
I had to go through?!

10:45.027 --> 10:46.497
I-I'm sorry!

10:46.497 --> 10:49.627
The game wouldn't let me 
back in until I recovered!

10:49.627 --> 10:50.467
I don't care!

10:50.467 --> 10:51.227
Get lost!

10:51.227 --> 10:51.997
Shoo! Shoo!

10:52.447 --> 10:53.377
Don't say that!

10:53.377 --> 10:57.117
A bearer of the blood of the blue wolf 
is pledging his undying loyalty to you!

10:57.487 --> 11:01.497
It was thanks to you 
that I got a second job!

11:02.147 --> 11:04.697
<i>You</i> got the second job?!

11:04.697 --> 11:07.847
I thought they'd made that public...

11:07.847 --> 11:11.927
Bullshit! How come you get all the luck?

11:11.927 --> 11:13.147
Calm down, please!

11:13.147 --> 11:15.847
I simply want to serve you!

11:15.847 --> 11:16.677
What's all that?

11:16.677 --> 11:19.617
Please! Please let me serve you!

11:19.987 --> 11:21.827
J-Just stay away from me!

11:21.827 --> 11:22.937
Got it?!

11:23.527 --> 11:25.047
Please...

11:25.417 --> 11:27.497
<i>Forget that idiot Huroi!</i>

11:28.387 --> 11:31.337
<i>I need to get that clue to 
Pagma no matter what!</i>

11:31.707 --> 11:32.797
<i>But...</i>

11:33.067 --> 11:37.407
<i>Kesan Canyon is filled 
with level 160 monsters.</i>

11:37.407 --> 11:39.217
<i>And even if I have a legendary job,</i>

11:39.217 --> 11:41.597
<i>my level is still just 45.</i>

11:41.597 --> 11:44.827
<i>There's no way that's high enough.</i>

11:49.437 --> 11:52.697
You want to make a stealth item?

11:52.697 --> 11:56.407
Then you'll need a Sylphid Scale.

11:56.667 --> 11:58.617
Sylphid Scale?

11:58.617 --> 11:59.407
Yes.

11:59.867 --> 12:04.167
They're small wind fairies whose 
scales have protective coloring.

12:04.167 --> 12:07.667
Though, as an ingredient, 
it's classified as cloth.

12:08.037 --> 12:09.317
Cloth, huh?

12:10.857 --> 12:12.367
<i>System guidance.</i>

12:12.367 --> 12:15.477
<i>You are using the skill 
"Legendary Blacksmith Creation."</i>

12:16.107 --> 12:18.777
Cape. Sylphid Scale.

12:16.107 --> 12:17.407
<i>What kind of item...</i>

12:19.737 --> 12:21.637
<i>Please design the item.</i>

12:20.117 --> 12:21.637
<i>Okay, I can do this.</i>

12:23.997 --> 12:25.777
<i>Bonuses have been added.</i>

12:25.777 --> 12:29.377
Old Man Khan, where can 
I get a Sylphid Scale?

12:30.267 --> 12:32.287
You're going on the hunt already?

12:32.287 --> 12:33.707
Let me see...

12:33.707 --> 12:38.157
If you want to stay close, you can defeat 
Frost Orcs in the Northern Snowfields.

12:38.567 --> 12:44.227
They instinctively detect and 
hunt Sylphids for their scales.

12:44.777 --> 12:48.747
It should be easier than 
catching an invisible fairy.

12:49.267 --> 12:50.687
Orcs, huh?

12:50.687 --> 12:52.007
Off I go!

12:54.277 --> 12:54.757
<b>Warm Giant Brown Bear Leather Hat</b>

12:55.067 --> 12:55.507
<b>Superior Warm Giant Brown Bear Leather Gloves</b>

12:55.817 --> 12:56.967
<b>Excellent Giant Brown Bear Leather Boots</b>

12:56.317 --> 12:56.967
<b>Warm Giant Brown Bear Leather Cloak</b>

12:58.007 --> 13:01.597
<i>I made this warm equipment 
for the Northern Snowfields!</i>

13:01.697 --> 13:04.807
<b>Giant Brown Bear Leather Set</b>

13:01.697 --> 13:04.807
<b>Defense</b>

13:01.697 --> 13:04.807
<b>Cold Resistance</b>

13:01.697 --> 13:04.807
<b></b>m 0 0 l 78 0 78 13 0 13

13:01.697 --> 13:04.807
<b></b>m 0 0 l 128 0 128 13 0 13

13:02.177 --> 13:04.807
<i>You received a set bonus.</i>

13:05.577 --> 13:07.287
Be careful.

13:07.287 --> 13:08.527
I'll be fine.

13:08.527 --> 13:10.407
I've got the Dagger of Ideals, too.

13:11.847 --> 13:14.857
He doesn't seem worried at all...

13:15.867 --> 13:19.447
The chance a Frost Orc 
will drop a Sylphid Scale

13:20.117 --> 13:22.517
is less than 1%...

13:28.387 --> 13:30.247
When this blizzard is over...

13:30.477 --> 13:34.507
I'm going back home to my family.

13:34.727 --> 13:36.237
Don't say that.

13:36.357 --> 13:39.487
We've been together (on watch) for thirty years.

13:40.197 --> 13:41.597
That's why I want to go home.

13:41.947 --> 13:44.327
I don't want to stand here freezing in the snow.

13:44.827 --> 13:48.057
I wanted to go from soldier to chief.

13:48.157 --> 13:51.727
I came here for my family.

13:52.037 --> 13:53.447
Grid?

13:53.447 --> 13:54.187
Yes.

13:54.187 --> 13:56.987
I really want to be by his side.

13:58.667 --> 14:02.067
He went to hunt Frost Orcs.

14:04.087 --> 14:06.157
I don't know what you're grumbling...

14:06.567 --> 14:09.167
but give me your damn scales, orcs!

14:09.167 --> 14:10.667
Take this! Blade—

14:11.647 --> 14:12.997
Well done, brother!

14:13.217 --> 14:15.957
Bows?! Orcs are supposed to be stupid!

14:20.577 --> 14:23.327
A-A surprise attack? No fair!

14:21.937 --> 14:25.097
<i>Warning. You have less than
10% HP remaining.</i>

14:25.327 --> 14:28.417
<i>Even if my Immortality skill 
triggers, there's too many...</i>

14:29.867 --> 14:31.517
<b></b>Title<b>
Apostle of Justice</b>

14:29.867 --> 14:31.517
<b></b>Strength appears in times of dire peril.
You will not die easily until the enemies in front of you are slain.<b></b>

14:30.157 --> 14:31.437
<i>System guidance.</i>

14:31.807 --> 14:34.937
<i>The passive ability of the
title "Apostle of Justice"</i>

14:33.817 --> 14:34.937
<i>This is...</i>

14:34.937 --> 14:38.817
<b></b>Title<b>
"Apostle of Justice"</b>

14:35.247 --> 14:37.677
<i>the title I got when I saved Huroi!</i>

14:35.247 --> 14:38.807
<i>has activated and increased 
all your stats by 30%.</i>

14:39.337 --> 14:41.567
<i>A new skill has unlocked.</i>

14:41.567 --> 14:45.197
<i>Then I suppose it wasn't a
complete waste to save him!</i>

14:45.607 --> 14:46.407
Take this!

14:46.407 --> 14:48.497
Unyielding Justice!

14:53.537 --> 14:54.917
<i>You have leveled up.</i>

14:55.197 --> 14:56.887
<i>Your HP has been restored.</i>

14:56.887 --> 14:57.707
Yes!

14:57.707 --> 14:59.837
With the skill from this title...

15:00.207 --> 15:01.357
Bring it on.

15:01.357 --> 15:03.857
I'll grind some levels while I hunt!

15:06.897 --> 15:10.757
How could I let Grid-sama go alone?

15:11.207 --> 15:14.107
But becoming the Partner 
of the Apostle of Justice

15:14.107 --> 15:15.817
lets me use a sword and shield.

15:16.737 --> 15:19.277
I, Huroi, am on my way!

15:19.777 --> 15:21.737
3 Days Later

15:21.737 --> 15:24.007
Fool! You shouldn't have poked your head out!

15:24.467 --> 15:26.347
He'll kill you if you look him in the eye.

15:26.687 --> 15:28.347
Damn it! This game is broken!

15:26.717 --> 15:28.427
He's a demon!

15:28.347 --> 15:31.617
I killed eighty orcs and
only got three scales!

15:31.617 --> 15:36.547
After three days grinding here, 
my level's practically doubled,

15:36.317 --> 15:39.087
<b>Sylphid Scale</b>

15:36.357 --> 15:39.087
<b></b>Items Acquired in<b> Frost Orc Village</b>

15:36.547 --> 15:39.087
but I'm not finding many scales.

15:40.537 --> 15:42.587
I'll wait for a few more to respawn.

15:42.587 --> 15:44.047
Grid-sama!

15:44.887 --> 15:46.267
You're safe!

15:46.267 --> 15:47.257
Huroi!

15:47.257 --> 15:48.757
What are you doing here?

15:49.107 --> 15:51.137
Khan-san told me I'd find you here.

15:51.657 --> 15:56.267
Please forgive me for being late.

15:56.587 --> 15:58.227
Knock that off.

15:58.817 --> 16:00.607
It's really annoying, so knock it off!

16:00.957 --> 16:03.567
I don't have time to deal with—

16:18.267 --> 16:20.377
<b>Frost Orc Chieftain
</b>has appeared<b></b>

16:18.547 --> 16:20.377
<i>You have entered combat.</i>

16:20.377 --> 16:22.497
Wh-Who is this guy?

16:22.837 --> 16:24.167
A field boss!

16:24.167 --> 16:27.027
He appeared because you defeated 
all the orcs in the village!

16:27.027 --> 16:28.347
He's level 140.

16:28.347 --> 16:30.097
That's way too high!

16:33.267 --> 16:35.517
Huroi, draw aggro!

16:37.017 --> 16:38.657
What are you doing?!

16:38.657 --> 16:41.317
You swore loyalty to me, right? 
So draw aggro!

16:41.567 --> 16:44.797
My Partner of the Apostle of Justice title

16:44.797 --> 16:47.197
gives me 30% to all 
stats when I'm with you!

16:47.197 --> 16:49.197
So? What does that have 
to do with anything?!

16:49.537 --> 16:50.947
We can fight it, together!

16:51.777 --> 16:53.217
Fine, together!

16:53.217 --> 16:56.087
But I get whatever it drops!

16:55.977 --> 16:57.667
<b></b>You've created a party.
<b>"Huroi"</b>

16:56.087 --> 16:57.667
O-Of course...

16:57.887 --> 16:59.377
You take the boss!

16:59.377 --> 17:00.627
O-Okay!

17:03.547 --> 17:05.537
You piece of shit orc!

17:05.537 --> 17:08.967
You might be big, 
but you're still just a pig!

17:08.967 --> 17:11.057
I'll turn you into ground pork!

17:12.917 --> 17:15.587
<i>"The Blacksmith's Wrath" 
skill has activated.</i>

17:15.587 --> 17:16.637
Take this!

17:16.637 --> 17:18.537
Unyielding Justice!

17:19.917 --> 17:22.067
<b></b>You obtained <b>Sylphid Scales</b> x2

17:19.957 --> 17:22.067
<i>You defeated the Frost Orc horde.</i>

17:22.067 --> 17:24.277
Yes! Now it's just the boss!

17:26.427 --> 17:29.667
Sorry. My taunt effect ran out.

17:29.667 --> 17:30.617
You should've said so!

17:30.617 --> 17:31.617
Damn it!

17:31.877 --> 17:33.077
Blade Wind!

17:33.617 --> 17:34.817
Now, Huroi!

17:34.817 --> 17:36.617
Right, Grid-sama!

17:38.747 --> 17:40.837
Unyielding Justice!

17:42.657 --> 17:44.487
You can use it, too?

17:44.487 --> 17:45.917
Then I'll help you!

17:52.817 --> 17:55.377
Just one attack does that much damage?

18:01.177 --> 18:02.357
Huroi!

18:02.357 --> 18:05.217
Damn it... All that damage stunned him?

18:07.307 --> 18:08.197
<i>What's this?</i>

18:08.197 --> 18:10.697
<i>He's going straight for the weaker one?</i>

18:11.187 --> 18:12.357
<i>What do I do?</i>

18:12.357 --> 18:16.437
<i>I can't handle him on my own!</i>

18:16.907 --> 18:20.667
<i>Do I run while he's attacking Huroi?</i>

18:21.167 --> 18:24.497
<i>But if I do that, Huroi will die!</i>

18:29.357 --> 18:34.507
<b></b>Title
<b>Legendary One

</b>When in great peril, one's heart becomes unbreakable.
The Legendary One is not easy to kill.

18:29.357 --> 18:34.507
<b>m 0 0 l 210 0 210 22 0 22</b>

18:29.927 --> 18:31.167
<i>System guidance.</i>

18:31.507 --> 18:34.507
<i>The passive skill of the title 
"Legendary One" has activated.</i>

18:35.057 --> 18:37.737
<i>You now have immunity to status effects.</i>

18:39.667 --> 18:42.307
<i>My fear is fading away...</i>

18:43.437 --> 18:46.897
<i>In the real world, I was always 
a side character in my own life.</i>

18:47.297 --> 18:51.487
<i>But in </i>Satisfy<i>, I can 
be the main character!</i>

18:49.607 --> 18:51.487
<b>m 0 0 l 200 0 200 42 0 42</b>

18:49.607 --> 18:51.487
<b><b>Sword of Self-Transcendence
</b>Class: Legendary

Attack: 356
Attack Speed: +6%
Accuracy: +10%
Defense: +10%
*Does target level + 200 additional damage
when attacking
*Generates skill "Transcend"</b>

18:51.837 --> 18:55.377
<i>So that I can always 
get whatever I want...</i>

18:56.657 --> 18:58.417
<i>No matter what happens...</i>

18:59.537 --> 19:02.617
I won't give up so easily!

19:15.587 --> 19:16.947
Grid-sama!

19:18.687 --> 19:21.267
I'm the one spearheading this boss raid...

19:21.267 --> 19:24.117
So don't go dying on me!

19:24.617 --> 19:26.477
Wh-Why?

19:27.647 --> 19:32.067
Forget that. I'm going to heal,
so get him off me.

19:33.117 --> 19:34.277
This is my fault.

19:34.617 --> 19:36.947
I'm so sorry.

19:36.947 --> 19:37.697
Here it comes!

19:37.987 --> 19:39.567
Worry not.

19:39.567 --> 19:43.287
I'll block any attacks heading your way!

19:44.417 --> 19:45.777
Indomitable Will!

19:46.287 --> 19:50.257
Your attacks can't touch me!

19:50.487 --> 19:52.007
Take this!

19:54.007 --> 19:55.507
Fire Bottles?

19:55.507 --> 19:57.017
You're well-prepared!

20:03.727 --> 20:06.847
Orcs can use stat-boost items?!

20:08.897 --> 20:10.857
Damn it! What do we do?

20:10.857 --> 20:14.107
Grid-sama, I leave the rest to you.

20:14.107 --> 20:15.797
Huh? Huroi?

20:17.377 --> 20:20.787
It's time to use this technique...

20:28.427 --> 20:30.917
Sacrifice for Justice.

20:50.557 --> 20:51.937
It didn't work, huh?

20:52.977 --> 20:54.007
Huroi...

20:54.767 --> 20:57.737
I'm sorry, Grid-sama...

20:58.257 --> 21:01.697
But I've lowered his defense.

21:02.037 --> 21:03.177
You...

21:03.177 --> 21:04.247
Good...

21:05.247 --> 21:06.837
luck...

21:08.987 --> 21:11.567
<i>Party member Huroi has perished.</i>

21:13.407 --> 21:16.387
You're kind of a stalker...

21:18.197 --> 21:19.347
But thanks.

21:20.467 --> 21:23.307
You've set me up perfectly!

21:29.327 --> 21:32.687
<b>Unyielding Justice
</b>Cooldown Ended

21:30.227 --> 21:32.687
<i>Your skill is off cooldown.</i>

21:33.277 --> 21:37.777
<i>The passive skill of the title 
"Apostle of Justice" has activated.</i>

21:39.207 --> 21:40.697
I've been waiting for this!

21:44.617 --> 21:47.577
Unyielding Justice!

21:53.167 --> 21:55.777
<i>You have defeated the Frost Orc Chieftain.</i>

21:59.987 --> 22:01.177
We did it.

22:01.547 --> 22:03.557
We did it!

22:03.597 --> 22:05.317
We did it, Huroi!

22:05.317 --> 22:08.227
But those drops are mine, okay?!
